s_for_language(locale)\nif voices.is_empty():\n    return\n\nvar id: int = (2**31) - 1\nprint(id)\nDisplayServer.tts_speak(\"Test\", voices[0], 50, 1.0, 1.0, id, true)\nDisplayServer.tts_set_utterance_callback(DisplayServer.TTS_UTTERANCE_ENDED, _CB_TTS_Utterance_Ended)\n\nfunc _CB_TTS_Utterance_Ended(p_utterance_id: int) -> void:\n\tprint(\"CALLBACK: \", p_utterance_id)\n```\n\n```\nCALL: 2147483647\nCALLBACK: 2147483647\n```\n\n2)\n```swift\nvar locale: String = TranslationServer.get_locale()\nvar voices: PackedStringArray = DisplayServer.tts_get_voices_for_language(locale)\nif voices.is_empty():\n    return\n\nvar id: int = (2**31)\nprint(id)\nDisplayServer.tts_speak(\"Test\", voices[0], 50, 1.0, 1.0, id, true)\nDisplayServer.tts_set_utterance_callback(DisplayServer.TTS_UTTERANCE_ENDED, _CB_TTS_Utterance_Ended)\n\nfunc _CB_TTS_Utterance_Ended(p_utterance_id: int) -> void:\n\tprint(\"CALLBACK: \", p_utterance_id)\n```\n\n```\nCALL: 2147483648\nCALLBACK: -2147483648\n```\n\nThis makes it impossible to use `Object.get_instance_id()` as the `utterance_id`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) Create an empty project with a node and a script attached to it.\n2) Add the code examples provided above inside the `_ready` function.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Utterance_Id_Signed_32_Bit.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23308505/Utterance_Id_Signed_32_Bit.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscri